IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PAY0001.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY PAY0001C.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    05 O-PY               PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM 2000-OVERTIME
    DISPLAY "O-PY=" O-PY
    STOP RUN.
2000-OVERTIME.
    *> NO OVERTIME FOR CONTRACTORS
    IF ET-CD = 'C'
        MOVE 0 TO O-PY
    *> HEAVY OVERTIME - LIMIT 75 PER 1998 POLICY
    ELSE IF HW-HH > 50
        COMPUTE O-PY ROUNDED = P-GR * 0.25
    *> STANDARD OVERTIME - LIMIT 33 PER 1998 POLICY
    ELSE IF HW-HH > 44
        COMPUTE O-PY = P-GR * 0.10
    ELSE
        MOVE 0.00 TO O-PY
    END-IF
    END-IF
    END-IF.
